  "description": "C# SDK for the SAP Business One Service Layer, multi-targeted for .NET 8 / .NET 6 / .NET Standard 2.0 (also runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2+). Auth with automatic session renewal, typed CRUD, fluent OData query builder (LINQ and string-based), transactional batch, raw SQL helper with parameter binding, UDF support, document actions (Close, Cancel, …), schema management (create UDTs, UDFs and UDOs programmatically), IAsyncDisposable for auto-logout, a logging hook and CancellationToken on every async method.",
  "id": "NikSBO",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-26T09:11:26.23Z",
